<BRK/>
][<TXT>Provide CRAC manufacturer's remote [room temperature sensor][,][ and][ rack mounted temperature sensor array][,][ and][ room humidity sensor].  
Sensors must meet the requirements of Section <SRF>23 09 13</SRF> INSTRUMENTATION AND CONTROL DEVICES FOR HVAC.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
