]</SPT></SPT>][<SPT><TTL>Supervisory CRAC Controls</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>In addition to stand alone controls, provide [a ]device[s] to network together all CRACs [in each computer room][in this contract][as indicated].  
The network device must integrate all data for each CRAC, as required under stand alone controls, and display it on any connected CRAC's display 
panel.[  The network device must optimize the operation of all connected CRACs to minimize energy use.]  The network device must balance runtime 
across all connected units.  The network device must automatically switch to a standby unit upon detection of failure of a duty unit.  Provide 
all control wiring among CRACs and network device[s] as required to meet this specification.</TXT><BRK/>
